    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin draws a subtle outline around block editor blocks (first four layers) and separates the title from the content.</p>\n<p><em>Be aware:</em> Once you worked with this plugin, you don&#8217;t want to use the block editor without it anymore 🙂</p>\n<p><strong>Contribute</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/meine-infoseite-de/meine-infoseite-block-highlighter\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://github.com/meine-infoseite-de/meine-infoseite-block-highlighter</a></p>\n<p><strong>Sponsored by</strong>: <a href=\"https://sachsen.tours\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">sachsen.tours</a></p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"are%20there%20any%20settings%3F\">\nAre there any settings?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No, the plugin has no settings.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20there%20a%20paid%20version%20%28pro%29%3F\">\nIs there a paid version (pro)?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No, there are no pro features or any upsell bloat we can think of. Feel free to use the <a href=\"https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/scrobbleme/5\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">donate link</a>.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.1.1 (2026-09-29)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Force the build pipeline to use the latest version of the plugin.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>PHP deprecation notices</em></p>\n<p>Starting with the next release, we will only support PHP versions not already EOL.<br />\nWe urge anyone to upgrade to a supported version as soon as possible.</p>\n<h4>2.1.0 (2026-09-29)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>The Custom HTML block highlighting was improved: CSS is shown (JS is not)</li>\n<li>The title will be more subtle now (if there is a huge font size defined in the theme)</li>\n<li>Tested with the latest WordPress</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.0 (2026-03-09)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First public release</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.x</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Internal only releases</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Helper plugin for highlighting blocks within the block editor.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin draws a subtle outline around block editor blocks (first four layers) and separates the title from the content.</p>\n<p><em>Be aware:</em> Once you worked with this plugin, you don&#8217;t want to use the block editor without it anymore 🙂</p>\n<p><strong>Contribute</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/meine-infoseite-de/meine-infoseite-block-highlighter\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://github.com/meine-infoseite-de/meine-infoseite-block-highlighter</a></p>\n<p><strong>Sponsored by</strong>: <a href=\"https://sachsen.tours\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">sachsen.tours</a></p>\n",
